---
title: "Prose lint"
prose-lint:
  banned: [utilize]
---

We we should fix this doubled word.

This is very fast and really clever.

Please utilize the new API.

`utilize` in code and $very$ in math and [the docs](https://utilize.example) stay clean,
and so does this fenced block:

```python
# utilize very very
x = 1
```
